/Users/i3eg1nner/code/cie/work/XiangShan-kmhv2/yunsuan/src/main/resources/espresso: ELF 64-bit LSB pie executable, x86-64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2, BuildID[sha1]=e1716c93907e28f83682bb00c94f3b679db86451, for GNU/Linux 3.2.0, stripped
解决：从源码构建 arm64 原生 espresso，并放到 PATH 前部（build.sc 把 resources 目录追加在 PATH 末尾，故前部优先）
$ git clone https://github.com/classabbyamp/espresso-logic
